      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I need eight Good Quality Fiberplast in total. The Veylan Groves have fiberplast shrubs; Scavenging rank 3 is required. Bring a partial bundle if you like, and I will count it toward the batch.",
